title: Server Technology Sentry PDU/CDU: Humidity sensors
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/power/servertech
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the humidity sensors (external probes) of Server Technology
 Sentry PDUs/CDUs. Both MIB generations are supported: Sentry3-MIB devices
 (e.g. "Sentry Smart CDU", sysObjectID .1.3.6.1.4.1.1718.3) and Sentry4-MIB
 devices (sysObjectID .1.3.6.1.4.1.1718.4).

 By default the thresholds configured on the device are used. If the rule
 "Humidity Levels" sets upper and/or lower levels for the service, only the
 levels from the rule are applied.

 Sensor problems reported by the device (lost, read error, no communication)
 are shown as CRIT.

item:
 The sensor ID followed by the sensor name, e.g. {A1 Temp_Humid_Sensor_A1}.

discovery:
 One service is created for each connected humidity sensor. Temperature-only
 probes and sensor slots reported as "not found" are ignored.
